[ColoredCollar_S]
ColoredCollar_S=上色描边σ
サイズ=尺寸
ぼかし=模糊
色拡散=颜色扩散
αしきい値=Alpha阈值
サイズ固定=固定尺寸
色設定=颜色设置
縁色=描边颜色
色の濃さ=颜色浓度
縁色外側=外侧描边颜色
その他=其他
錯視軽減=减缓错视

;[Tips.ColoredCollar_S]
;effect.name=Creates a colored border around objects, extending their edges and/or applying color gradients based on distance.
;色拡散=When extending the colors of the edges of the object, blur them based on distance.
;縁色外側=Specifying a different color or opacity creates a gradient based on distance.
;錯視軽減=Reduces visually distracting patterns in the distance-based gradient by "Blur" and/or "Outer Color".
